### A blank line ends the headers
POST https://example.com/notes
Accept: */*

Content-Type: text/plain
X-Trace: 1
hello

### Header-like lines after body text are content
POST https://example.com/notes
Content-Type: text/plain

https://example.com/link
Note: this line comes after body text

### JSON keys are quoted, so they're never headers
POST https://example.com
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "note": "fine"
}

### A text body may start with a header-like line
POST https://example.com/mail
Content-Type: text/plain

Subject: hi
Dear all,

### So may a YAML body
POST https://example.com/config
Content-Type: application/yaml

name: pets
replicas: 2

### A JSON body never starts with one
POST https://example.com
Content-Type: application/json

Authorization: Bearer t
{}
